WEBVTT

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:05.930
bokura nara daijoubu

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:05.930
Because we’re still doing okay,

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:12.390
mada tsuyoku nareru kara

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:12.390
we can become even stronger!

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.900
takaihiroi sora megake

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.900
Aiming for the tall and wide sky,

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.450
kinou made no boku wo hanatsu

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.450
I let go of what I was up until yesterday.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:24.260
miesuita uso mo, taikutsu na

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:24.260
Those lies that were easily seen through and my tedious day-by-day life;

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:26.980
hibi mo, zenbu hodoite

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:26.980
I left them both behind.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:29.870
atarashii asa ni me wo hosome

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:29.870
I narrowed my eyes at the new morning

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:33.280
kyou mo bokutachi wa ikiteku

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:33.280
Today we shall also venture out
to live our lives again.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:36.720
sukoshi nami utsu sabishisadatte

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:36.720
Even the slight loneliness that sometimes comes about,

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.460
taisetsu ni omoeteru

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.460
I consider important.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:45.070
itsuka kanjita shinjitsu mo

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:45.070
Even the truth I felt some day…

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:51.440
massugu koko kara asu ni mukatteru

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:51.440
…is urging us to go on into the future.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:56.450
bokutachi ga mezashita sekai

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:56.450
The world that we had all aimed for…

00:00:56.450 --> 00:01:03.470
donna kakomo kakaeta mama kitto tadoritsuku

00:00:56.450 --> 00:01:03.470
We will arrive at it, no matter what our pasts are.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:08.460
fumidashita kewashii michi mo

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:08.460
We continued forward, even if it is a steep path…

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:11.900
bokura nara daijoubu,

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:11.900
…because we’re still doing okay,

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:18.280
mada tsuyoku nareru kara

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:18.280
and we can become even stronger!

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:40.740
Nozomu-chan!

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:43.660
Kaoruko-chan! Sumireko-chan!

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:45.290
Nozomu-kun!

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:47.730
Kira-chan! Yura-chan!

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:50.860
No, Nozomu-chan! Look this way!

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:53.870
Oh yeah!

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:57.250
Don’t do that, Nozomu-kun!
Look this way!

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:03.890
Sheesh… Nozomu-chan, you’re so mean!

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.520
Sheesh… Nozomu-kun, you’re so mean!

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:09.840
It’s not that…

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:12.940
Wait a minute.

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:17.280
Hey everyone, it hurts!

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:18.780
Nozomu-chan!

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:21.040
Ow! Stop it!

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:22.540
Nozomu-kun!

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:25.980
Ow!

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:28.500
Stop it!

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:31.380
You!

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:36.970
You little–

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.970
Good morning, Onii-chan!

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:46.140
Ah, good morning.

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:47.640
Billy!

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.080
So Billy was over here!

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:56.800
Since you’re here this morning to play,
you must really like Onii-chan!

00:02:56.800 --> 00:03:00.820
He definitely doesn’t like me;
in fact, he really detests me!

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.320
Onii-chan, let’s go play together!

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:11.580
We have a new game!

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:16.050
Sorry, I promised to go
to the movies with a friend.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:17.900
This “friend”…

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:19.260
isn’t a girl, right?

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:21.140
It’s a guy.

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:25.940
Eh? You just transferred schools yesterday,
yet you’ve made a close friend already.

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:30.130
It’s not that. It was Kosaka,
whom I’ve known since kindergarten.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:36.940
Kosaka-kun, please
take care of Nozomu-kun.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:38.920
Yes, ma’am!

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:41.490
Please take care of Nozomu-oniichan!

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:43.190
Okay.

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:46.810
Hey, let’s get going.

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:50.520
It’s incredible, Nozomu!

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:51.230
Eh?

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:56.290
You’re living under one roof with a pretty woman and her cute twins!

00:03:56.770 --> 00:03:58.800
Is that so?

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:01.370
That’s on top of what happened yesterday…

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:05.910
We have transfer students Futami Nozomi-kun,

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:09.390
Sakurazaki Kira-san, and Sakurazaki Yura-san.

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:12.830
The two look exactly the same!

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:14.400
It’s rare to see someone so cute!

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.590
Where am I in all this?

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:21.030
I’m glad that I’m in the same class as Nozomu-kun!

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:25.330
We’ve always been in a private girls school,
so we weren’t prepared for this.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:28.980
What’s going on?

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:36.100
Didn’t I tell you?
I ran into them by coincidence.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:38.360
I already know that.

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:40.720
You can’t always have everything go your way, you know.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:42.220
I guess so.

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:44.490
Dammit…

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:47.870
If I were the one in the convenience store…

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:51.170
Hey you, what about the Ichijou sisters?

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:57.960
Nozomu-chan!

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:58.940
Shall we go home together?

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:09.430
That’s because we were next door neighbors when we were kids.

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:11.400
I already know that.

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:13.710
You can’t always have everything go your way, you know.

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:15.980
You’re sounding like a broken record.

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:17.850
Dammit.

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:20.750
If I were the next door neighbor,
I would already have…

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:22.150
Yeah, yeah.

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:25.150
It’s all luck, you know.

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:27.720
I don’t think it’s just that…

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:30.370
It must be nice to have such good luck,

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:32.290
but being brash about it is dangerous.

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:35.900
The Ichijou sisters have a rather extreme fan club.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.350
Eh? Fan club?

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:43.710
Everyone who approaches the Ichjijou sisters gets hurt.

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:48.180
Fact is, the Ichijou sisters aren’t even aware of the existence of their fan club.

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:52.200
Oh, speak of the devil…
and do you see his horns?

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:10.760
Are you the transfer student Futami?

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:13.060
I am.

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:19.210
I am Konda Juntaro, from class 3-3.

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:23.500
I’m president of the Ichijou sisters fan club and the captain of the judo team.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:26.210
I am a judo black belt,
kanji authorization level 4-kyu.

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:27.320
Nice to meet you.

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:31.470
I hear you’re very close to the Ichijou sisters. Is that right?

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:34.560
Umm… we were childhood friends.

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:37.230
They used to live next door.

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:44.370
Oh? Is that so?

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:52.070
You don’t seem to be Kaoruko-chan and Sumireko-chan’s type, I guess.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:54.160
His reasoning is unsound.

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:55.840
However, I have no way to counter it.

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:02.710
But! If you get close to them on the pretense of being childhood friends,

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:04.800
I don’t expect you to live to see the next day. Remember that.

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:14.800
See? Be careful with them.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:16.310
Yeah.

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:17.520
Now, let’s go watch the movie!

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:19.620
What is it?

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:22.400
I forgot the discount coupons for the movie theater.

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:24.590
I’ll go back and get them.

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:26.030
But…

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:29.340
These coupons have
a 200 yen discount each!

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:31.540
I get it…

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:36.750
Oh yeah, he’s been picky about various things since childhood.

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:39.620
If we can’t make it,
we can watch the next show.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.940
I’ll wait for you here
in two hours. See you later!

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:45.340
I guess it can’t be helped.

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:47.920
The Fukubukuya department store!

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:51.220
It’s so nostalgic.
I think I’ll go take a look.

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:02.150
Whoa. It’s become more fashionable.

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:06.990
It has been more than ten years since.

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:10.710
Ah, it’s Nozomu-chan!

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:12.470
Nozomu-chan!

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:15.040
Kaoruko-chan! Sumireko-chan!

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.290
I’m so happy!

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:21.750
We meet here of all places!

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:23.600
What’s wrong?

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:27.590
No, it’s nothing.

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:30.940
I was just thinking about how we played here when we were little.

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:32.680
So that’s it!

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:34.490
Are you shopping as well?

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:37.100
Not exactly.

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:41.330
I’m watching a movie with Keisuke,
but we have to wait for two hours.

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:44.190
Eh?! LUCKY!

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:46.270
Nozomu-chan, why don’t you kill those two hours…

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:47.880
by coming along with us?

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:48.940
Eh?

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:50.360
Let’s go to the roof together!

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:53.260
Yeah! We can eat ice cream,
just like old times!

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.120
Eh? Uhh…

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:56.820
No good?

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:59.390
How could I refuse?

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:01.380
I’m glad.

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:02.100
Let’s go.

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:07.580
However, we would like you to accompany us to buy something first.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:08.340
That’s fine with me.

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:09.590
I’m glad!

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:12.340
Isn’t this a great situation?

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:14.220
This isn’t another dream, right?

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:21.250
What’s wrong?

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:24.070
Ah, it’s nothing.

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:26.920
I hope that I don’t run into them again.

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:47.480
Misses, it’s finally time for
the third of your father’s ordeals.

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:48.920
Yes!

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:51.730
Ordeal number 3, shopping at the department store!

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:54.170
Here’s your purse.

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:57.910
To prevent a repeat of what happened the other day, I have attached a strap.

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:00.190
Thank you, Kenmochi-san.

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:02.890
Let us go, Yura-chan.

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:04.270
Yes, Kira-chan.

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:12.870
So, what are you going to buy?

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:14.300
Here.

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:19.470
Swimsuits?

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.250
Ah! This is so cute!

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:25.040
Don’t you have a good feeling about this?

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:26.330
Right, Nozomu-chan?

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:28.710
We’re going to try them out.
Do you want to watch?

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:29.840
Try them out?

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:34.940
I’m… going to shop for other stuff!

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:36.830
He’s strange.

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:39.060
Maybe he’s embarrassed.

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:46.270
That surprised me.

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:49.360
Why would they allow me to watch them try out the swimsuits?

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:51.200
Trying on swimsuits?

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:54.400
Maybe I should go take a look.

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:57.840
That’s it! They did ask me to watch!

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:00.620
I’m going back!

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:03.700
Ah, Nozomu-kun!

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:04.430
Eh?

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:08.380
Kira-chan! Yura-chan!

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:09.820
What’s wrong?

00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:14.160
Nozomu-kun, w-we…

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:16.070
don’t know where to go!

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:18.170
Eh? What happened?

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:20.180
We’re shopping here…

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:23.300
but the department store is so much bigger than the convenience store!

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:26.790
We don’t know where
anything is, so we’re lost!

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:30.190
You’re lost? Is that so?

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:34.630
If it is okay, I’ll help you find what you’re looking for.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:36.070
Really?

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:36.730
Yeah.

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:38.240
So, what are you buying?

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:41.200
A pot holder and…

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:43.140
a platinum eggbeater!

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:45.830
I never knew they sold such things.

00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:50.460
Let’s see… kitchenware is located…

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:52.650
on the second floor.

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:57.250
Thank you, Nozomu-kun!

00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:00.670
This is another act of kindness that we will repay.

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:02.870
Oh no, this isn’t anything significant.

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:05.550
Are you shopping as well, Nozomu-kun?

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:07.040
Who did you come with?

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:12.190
Well, you see… I came with our classmate, Kosaka Keisuke.

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:13.710
I’m waiting for him.

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:15.500
Is that so?

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:17.590
Then we’ll have to return this favor next time.

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:20.080
Sorry about that.

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:22.300
See you later.

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:25.970
I didn’t say that I was with Kaoruko-chan and Sumireko-chan.

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:28.920
Is this how men are supposed to act?

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:32.260
Oh yeah, the swimsuits!

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:47.140
Sumireko, this definitely fits you!

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:50.290
Kaoruko, I think yours is a bit daring, but it’s also pretty cute.

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:52.190
Daring?

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:55.880
Eh?

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:58.150
Ah, Nozomu-chan!

00:12:58.150 --> 00:13:02.340
That’s too bad. If you were a bit quicker,
you could have seen us try these on.

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:05.160
Yeah, I guess so.

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.340
It really is a pity.

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:10.700
Let’s go to the beach together during summer!

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:11.410
Okay!

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:13.350
Okay, now let’s go to the roof
and eat ice cream!

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:14.630
Okay!

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:21.630
What’s wrong? You stopped suddenly.

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:22.320
What is it?

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:36.780
I suddenly wanted to
act like a mannequin!

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:41.150
Is that so? You wanted to act like a toy.

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:42.320
I’m relieved.

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:43.790
Okay, let’s go on up!

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:48.870
Wait! Let’s ride the elevator.

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:50.330
Eh? Why?

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:52.220
Wouldn’t the escalator be faster?

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:57.040
Uhh… the elevator is very nostalgic.

00:13:57.040 --> 00:13:58.320
We often used to ride it together.

00:13:58.320 --> 00:14:00.000
That’s right.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.220
Okay, let’s do that!

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:06.850
I’m sorry… I lied.

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:13.910
It’s really changed a lot.

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:16.180
It’s completely different from what I remember.

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:17.190
I guess so.

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:24.860
However, the ice cream flavors haven’t changed.

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:25.630
Is that so?

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:29.080
Could you go save a spot for us?

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:33.460
You still like strawberry, right?

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:36.750
So could you hold this for us, please?

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:52.890
Eh? Kira-chan and Yura-chan were going up the escalator.

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:54.290
If they come up to the roof…

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:57.140
Didn’t you say you were
with Kosaka-kun?

00:14:57.140 --> 00:14:59.500
You tricked us!

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.830
You’re mean!

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:03.590
And also…

00:15:04.440 --> 00:15:07.820
How dare you hide the fact that you’re with the Sakurazuki twins?

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:09.450
It’s really suspicious!

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:10.990
We’re totally misjudged you!

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:11.990
This is bad!

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:13.550
This could also happen…

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:15.990
Nozomu-chan belongs to us!

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:19.270
No! Nozomu-kun belongs to us!

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:22.510
Don’t tug me like that!

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:26.680
Oh, it’s the laughing Onii-chan!

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:29.690
To have such energy every day is very incredible.

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:33.770
This is the pits.

00:15:35.970 --> 00:15:37.040
Is it Kira-chan and Yura-chan?

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:41.820
This is even worse!

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:47.210
There are two empty chairs.

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:49.510
I thought this would be impossible…

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:53.300
Nozomu-kun!

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:58.800
Oh, it isn’t the Ichijou sisters.

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:00.550
See ya.

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:03.630
Let’s go to the video game arcade.

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:04.810
Okay!

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:09.650
I’m still in trouble!

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:11.650
Nozomu-kun!

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:14.340
We’re still in trouble!

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:16.070
Please help us!

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:23.690
A Gorgeous Set!?

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:29.070
Papa’s fourth ordeal is to
“order a Gorgeous Set and eat it”.

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:31.460
But that combo isn’t on the menu.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:38.480
Few people ordered the Gorgeous Set because of its price, and it got removed.

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:39.720
Eh?

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:43.000
Don’t worry. At the counter,

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:46.190
you should say “Please give us
the same thing as the Gorgeous Set.”

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:48.750
That’s it!

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:51.590
To be able to do that is so incredible!

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:53.820
It’s nothing.
You’re blowing it out of proportion.

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:56.110
Thank you, Nozomu-kun.

00:16:56.800 --> 00:16:58.650
We owe him another favor.

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:01.730
Oh, it’s okay.

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:02.800
Good luck.

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:03.400
Okay!

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:09.620
Shoot! I’ve got to hurry!

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:15.880
Nozomu-chan!

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:18.370
Where did you go?

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:20.160
I went to the restroom.

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:24.550
So… let’s go over there to look at the scenery while eating the ice cream, okay?

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:33.760
You’re right! This feels better than sitting at the table!

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:35.950
The ferris wheel
used to be around that area.

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:39.940
We can see things really clearly here!

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:42.330
I see the preschool!

00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:46.830
Ah, that! It’s really nostalgic…

00:17:57.360 --> 00:17:59.800
Somehow, I’m getting goosebumps.

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:09.040
We’ve got two of them!

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:12.550
We can now give these stuffed toys to both Ichijou sisters!

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:15.820
We’ll sneak these into their shoe lockers as a gift!

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:18.870
They will definitely be happy.

00:18:19.470 --> 00:18:22.150
Their smiles are our happiness.

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:30.150
Ah, that was good.

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:32.170
Yeah! It’s definitely the best.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:41.680
You two, let’s go over there.

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:45.810
The wind is getting a bit chilly.

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:48.770
I don’t feel the chill.

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:50.810
Anyway, let’s go over there.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:08.020
You’re acting very weird today, Nozomu-chan.

00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:09.480
Yeah! Really weird!

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:11.530
Umm… I…

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:14.670
Nozomu-kun!

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:16.950
We’ve finished the purchase!

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:19.740
Ah! The Sakurazuki twins!

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:21.960
Ah! It’s the Ichijou twins!

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:35.520
Hello!

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:40.740
Nozomu-chan was shopping together with us.

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:44.300
It was the first time we came to a department store, and it was very difficult.

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:46.750
Nozomu-kun helped us out twice!

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:48.750
So that’s what happened!

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:53.770
Umm… we don’t know
where we should eat…

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:56.140
You can do so over there at the tables.

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:57.570
Is that so?

00:19:57.570 --> 00:20:01.580
We’re going to get something to drink.
Why don’t we sit together?

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:05.410
We’re happy! We’ll do that.

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:06.850
So, let’s go!

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:11.460
I guess it turned out like that.

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:14.880
I’m just childhood friends with
Kaoruko-chan and Sumireko-chan.

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:18.130
Helping Kira-chan and Yura-chan was to repay a favor.

00:20:18.130 --> 00:20:20.320
How could there be a problem?

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:23.660
But, in the end, I…

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:29.720
It’s like happiness in the movies!

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:32.830
Nozomu-chan! It’s been two hours.

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:37.660
It’s about time you met up
with Keisuke-kun.

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:41.200
That’s right…
you should be with Kosaka-kun.

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:42.870
Have a good time!

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:45.760
We’ll return the favor next time.

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:05.120
Umm, you got worn out within two hours?

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:09.830
Please call me a man who has gone through heaven and hell.

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:11.400
Huh?

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:19.770
Dad, Mom…

00:21:19.770 --> 00:21:24.120
I’m finally living a happy life in this city.

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:29.460
Even though I’m saying this,
today was a mess.

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:33.250
No, I can’t dwell on the bad things!

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:35.720
Good things will definitely come my way!

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:58.000
dokomademo tsuzuku sora

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:58.000
Oh, the sky that continues no matter where you go…

00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:04.050
daisuki na kono machi de

00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:04.050
In this town that I love…

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:10.010
takusan no omoide to, hora,

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:10.010
With all our memories, now look!

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:16.020
onaji dake hohoende

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:16.020
We are smiling the same way

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:26.700
itsudemo kimi no tonari ni iyoutoshiteru no wa

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:26.700
To always be trying to be besides you…

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:39.020
mukashi kara no kuse datte omotteru kedo

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:39.020
…is, I believe, a bad habit I’ve had for a long time

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:45.140
“mata ashita” tte te wo furu toki ni wa

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:45.140
When we wave our hands saying “see you tomorrow,”

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:50.930
sukoshi dake samishii kigasuru yo

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:50.930
I realize that I’m feeling a little lonely at that moment

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:57.230
tooku naru kimi no senaka mitsumete

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:57.230
Staring at your back that is getting further away,

00:22:57.230 --> 00:23:03.190
nandaka, fushigi na kimochi

00:22:57.230 --> 00:23:03.190
For some reason, a mysterious feeling…

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:09.090
kono mune ni hirogatte yuku

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:09.090
…is spreading through this heart of mine

00:23:10.970 --> 00:23:11.950
This is Miyabi.

00:23:12.390 --> 00:23:15.350
It seems there’s an elective class in school.

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:18.520
The girls are making apple pie, but…

00:23:18.520 --> 00:23:20.960
will it be delicious?

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:24.170
The flavor of love in apple pie!
